  "fields": {
    "narrative": "A query contract with an input parameter \"name\" and nullable result property Status first builds one add expression for \"name\" when it is not ignored. It resolves a returned column called \"STATUS\" through case-insensitive field lookup; if the resolved column contains DBNull, the generated reader expression sets Status to null. A second build for \"name\" using the same parameter-name set adds no duplicate parameter expression.",
